    <description>
      <levelledPara>
        <title>Lift cylinder</title>
        <para>The lift cylinder raises the platform when the pump supplies fluid.</para>
        <para applicRefId="app-L100">The L100 has a single-stage cylinder with a stroke of 1.2 m.</para>
        <para applicRefId="app-L200">The L200 has a two-stage telescopic cylinder with a stroke of 2.4 m.</para>
        <para applicRefId="app-L200-late">Late L200 lifts with the cold-weather kit have a heated return line.</para>
      </levelledPara>
      <levelledPara applicRefId="app-L200">
        <title>Telescopic stages</title>
        <para>The second stage extends only after the first stage is fully out.</para>
      </levelledPara>
    </description>
